      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Albumist analyzes your photos only on this device to suggest albums. It creates albums and folders in Photos, and adds or removes photos in them, only after you confirm. No photo is ever uploaded, and your originals are never changed."
